      "sessionTarget": "main",
      "wakeMode": "now",
      "payload": {
        "kind": "systemEvent",
        "text": "[HEARTBEAT] Perform system health check and auto-stabilization:\nNote: Heartbeat firing implies gateway is running.\n1. Check for stale lock file at .openclaw-state/openclaw.lock; delete it if present.\n2. Verify all critical agents (pluto, coder, social, osint, generalist) are responsive; if any are stuck, restart them.\n3. Check all active subagent tasks: if any have been running longer than their ETA (or >30 minutes by default), report to user with task details. For incomplete tasks past reasonable time, prompt agent to complete or escalate if blocker.\n4. Report a brief summary of actions taken (or \"All systems stable\") to this chat.\nExecute quietly without asking questions. Do NOT use browser tools to probe the gateway — the gateway being alive is already confirmed by this heartbeat firing.\nEscalation: Only notify user for difficult blockers; otherwise take best decision to achieve goal."
      },
      "state": {
        "nextRunAtMs": 1771441200000,
        "lastRunAtMs": 1771439400026,
        "lastStatus": "ok",
        "lastDurationMs": 89625,
        "consecutiveErrors": 0
      }
    },
