        "kind": "systemEvent",
        "text": "[REMINDER] Today is the day to install the OpenClaw Windows service to fix sleep/wake flicker and ensure 24/7 uptime. Steps: 1) Install NSSM from https://nssm.cc/download. 2) Run PowerShell as Administrator and execute: .\\install-gateway-service.ps1 (in D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw). 3) Verify service is running: Get-Service OpenClawGateway. 4) Test sleep/wake and WhatsApp reconnection. This addresses the 5-10 second restart loop. Refer to QUICKSTART.md and SERVICE_SETUP.md for details."
      },
